flowchart TD
    A[Seeded particles in log LR, dropout, log weight decay] --> B[Decode and clamp to bounds]
    B --> C[Initialize fresh compact U-Net]
    C --> D[Train on train split for 2 epochs]
    D --> E[Compute mean per-image validation Dice]
    E --> F[Fitness = 1 - Dice]
    F --> G[Update personal and global best]
    G --> H{Rounds complete?}
    H -- No --> I[Update velocity and position]
    I --> B
    H -- Yes --> J[Export best hyperparameters and search history]
    J --> K[Initialize fresh U-Net for final 8-epoch training]
